# CODEOWNERS — Risk-Tiered Review
#
# Replace @org/team placeholders with your actual GitHub team names.
#
# Tier classification:
#   Red    — Security-critical (requires security team review)
#   Yellow — API/infrastructure (requires platform team review)
#   Green  — Docs, tests, configs (standard review, auto-approve eligible)
#
# Reference: Agentic Development Checklist (F1: Red/Yellow/Green tiers)

# =============================================================================
# Red Tier — Security-critical paths (MUST have security review)
# =============================================================================

/.claude/settings.json     @org/security-team
/.claude/hooks*            @org/security-team
/.github/workflows/        @org/security-team
*.env*                     @org/security-team
**/auth*                   @org/security-team
**/secret*                 @org/security-team
docker-compose*            @org/security-team

# =============================================================================
# Yellow Tier — API and infrastructure changes
# =============================================================================

# Customize these paths to match your project structure
api/                       @org/platform-team
server.*                   @org/platform-team
**/middleware*              @org/platform-team
scripts/                   @org/platform-team

# =============================================================================
# Green Tier — Documentation, tests, configs (auto-approve eligible)
# =============================================================================

docs/                      @org/dev-team
tests/                     @org/dev-team
*.md                       @org/dev-team
